{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上角最大号的两行标题首先吸引视线：紫色“不再需要他陪”，接着是灰白色“一下安静了”。正文和右上角阶段目录明显次于标题。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不再需要他陪伴，状态突然安静下来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、平静、收住了。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想靠近的劲其实还绷着，并没有真正松开；此前几乎要冲出去的势头突然停住，仍有未释放的情绪张力。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"正文三行连续长句，想靠近却没有真正放下的情绪反差，需要进一步阅读才能获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e2056ce-3ba9-44b5-825b-fb75d82e720e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020907626791Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:09:35.614530+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "48944555177d2565e380379cd4946578ab226d7abf367bb25737ef5ccf4de2d0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screens